{{!--
  ONE POOL ROW ON A CREATURE'S SHEET (D-705).

  Lifted whole out of `npc-statistics.hbs`, which drew both pools inline, so
  the Statistics tab and the Spells tab cannot draw the same pool two ways.

  It carries **no Spend row**, deliberately: `spendPool` is the character
  sheet's control and this sheet does not register it, so a Spend button here
  would be a silent no-op (D-681). A creature's Power moves when it casts.

  It DOES carry the stepper (the lead, 2026-09-13), because a GM moving a
  creature's Power by hand is the same want as moving a character's, and this
  sheet registers `stepPool` for it.

  The context is `#pool()`'s own row: `{held, name, label, value, max, segments}`
  plus the `key`, `title` and `editable` the sheet spreads on (D-609), where
  `name` is already the LOCALIZATION KEY of the pool's type rather than its
  key — so there is no `is-mana` class to hang a colour on here, as there is on
  the character's `pool.hbs`.
--}}
<div class="azeroth-pool">
  <div class="azeroth-pool-head{{#unless this.held}} is-absent{{/unless}}">
    {{!-- Keyed on the NAME, not on `held`: a creature holding a pool its
          block does not name (every non-Boss, since the tier's floor) has
          `name` null, and keying on `held` printed an empty label. --}}
    <span class="azeroth-pool-label">{{#if this.name}}{{localize this.name}}{{else}}{{localize this.label}}{{/if}}</span>
    {{#if this.held}}{{#if this.editable}}
    <span class="azeroth-pool-count azeroth-pool-step">
      <button type="button" class="azeroth-uses-step" data-action="stepPool" data-delta="-1"
              data-item-id="" data-kind="{{this.key}}"
              aria-label="{{localize "AZEROTH.Sheet.PoolDown" name=(localize this.title)}}"{{#unless this.value}} disabled{{/unless}}>&minus;</button>
      <input type="number" class="azeroth-pool-value" data-item-id="" data-kind="{{this.key}}"
             value="{{this.value}}" min="0" max="{{this.max}}" step="1"
             aria-label="{{localize "AZEROTH.Sheet.PoolValue" name=(localize this.title)}}">
      <span class="azeroth-pool-of">/ {{this.max}}</span>
      <button type="button" class="azeroth-uses-step" data-action="stepPool" data-delta="1"
              data-item-id="" data-kind="{{this.key}}"
              aria-label="{{localize "AZEROTH.Sheet.PoolUp" name=(localize this.title)}}"{{#if (eq this.value this.max)}} disabled{{/if}}>+</button>
    </span>
    {{else}}
    <span class="azeroth-pool-count">{{this.value}} / {{this.max}}</span>
    {{/if}}{{else}}
    <span class="azeroth-pool-count">&mdash;</span>
    {{/if}}
  </div>
  <div class="azeroth-pool-track">
    {{#each this.segments}}<span class="azeroth-segment{{#if this.filled}} is-filled{{/if}}"></span>{{/each}}
  </div>
</div>
